# One story — YMS overlay

Generic cycle lives in AgenticTemplate `one-story-one-ship.mdc` (do not recopy).

**This project’s human gate:** deploy to `Mods\YardMasterSuite\` + user Tier 2 PASS (or waive) per [deploy-before-smoke.mdc](deploy-before-smoke.mdc). Waiting on that is a **pause** — do not start the next PM story while the current DLL/HUD ship is uncommitted.

Docs/rules-only commits that do not change the game DLL may land without Tier 2; they still must not mix with an unfinished deployable story’s WIP unless the user agrees.
